1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
这碗解暑饮料，曾是宫里的方子
This summer cooler was a palace recipe

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
酸梅汤，出自清宫御膳房
Sour plum drink, from the Qing court

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
太医的"乌梅饮"，取其收敛
A court physician's "wumei" tonic

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
乾隆赐名：清宫异宝
Qianlong called it "a palace treasure"

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
更早，宋人喝"卤梅水"
Even earlier: Song-era "lu mei" water

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
乌梅、山楂、桂花、冰糖
Smoked plum, hawthorn, osmanthus, sugar

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
一熬一晾，酸甜生津
Boil, cool, sweet-sour and reviving

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
老北京的夏天，透心的凉
Old Beijing summer, cool to the heart

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
北京话说：倍儿敞亮，得嘞
Beijingers say "chang-liang," "dei le"

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
虾、烤、冰、酸——夏夜四味齐了
Crayfish, grill, ice, sour — night complete

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
你的夏夜，第一口选哪个？
Your summer night — first bite is?

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
关注，明天带你继续吃中国
Follow — more of China tomorrow
